on-arrival: resources -= 1; rfb_strength += 100; rfb_militancy += 0.1; kpd_relation += 3; ddp_relation -= 2 if not ddp_in_popular_front or ddp_in_popular_front_prussia; z_relation -= 3 if not in_popular_front or in_popular_front_prussia; dvp_relation -= 5; hindenburg_angry += 10; hindenburg_angry_bruning += 10; ddp_relation -= 2 if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia; z_relation -= 3 if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia; dvp_relation -= 5 if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia; hindenburg_angry += 10 if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia; hindenburg_angry_bruning += 10 if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia; reformist_dissent += 2; reformist_dissent += 3 if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia; center_dissent += 3 if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia; new_middle_spd -= 2*(1-dissent) if not new_middle_conscious; old_middle_spd -= 2*(1-dissent); rural_spd -= 2*(1-dissent) if not rural_conscious; catholics_spd -= 2*(1-dissent) if not in_popular_front or in_popular_front_prussia; new_middle_spd -= 2*(1-dissent) if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia; old_middle_spd -= 2*(1-dissent) if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia; rural_spd -= 2*(1-dissent) if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia; catholics_spd -= 2*(1-dissent) if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia;

我々は<span style="color: #700000;">反ファシズム</span><span style="color: #c00000;">行動</span>に資金を提供した。掲げたのは、<span style="color: #7A3C00;">ファシズム</span>に対抗する統一戦線である。

<span style="color: #000000;">ブルジョワ</span>諸政党は、これを[? if rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia:非合法の準軍事組織の偽装団体への?][? if not (rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia):準軍事組織への?]物質的支援だと非難している。その組織は<span style="color: #700000;">共産主義</span>勢力のものである。[? if (reformist_strength >= 20 and not (rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia)) or (reformist_strength + center_strength >= 20 and (rfb_banned or rfb_banned_prussia)): 我が党でも多くの者がこの批判に同調している。?]

